# Exam track — Theme: Gesond Liewen — Sub-lesson 3: Talking About It
# @question sentences: the examiner asks in Luxembourgish, the learner
# assembles the Luxembourgish answer (always en→lu).
#
# These are Sergii's and his wife's real answers, gathered by interview over
# several class rounds — do not "improve" or genericize them in a later editing
# pass. The point is that the learner rehearses what they will actually say in
# the Sproochentest.
#
# Where two rounds gave different answers the LATER round wins (user decision):
# sport is Kendo plus dog walks and the bike — not tennis/squash; the disliked
# childhood vegetable is Aubergine; the parents cooked Kniddelen, Nuddelen,
# Grompere mat Fleesch, Pasta and Zoppen (all of them).
#
# Key personal facts: health means eating well, moving and sleeping well; eats
# fruit and vegetables daily, cooks with a steam oven with his wife, buys organic
# because it is not chemical; eats meat so pure vegetarian/vegan is impossible,
# but finds vegetarian healthy; sweets are the weak point, plus occasional junk
# food in front of the TV (crisps, salted nuts); breakfast yoghurt, apple,
# coffee; as a child ate sweets and a Ukrainian filled sweet called "verréckt
# Bei", disliked Aubergine then and still does; no gym — no time in the week, too
# tired at the weekend; Kendo (Japanese fencing) two years in Kyiv fifteen years
# ago and six months in Luxembourg four years ago, stopped for work, would like
# to return to the Luxembourg Kendo club; football in a school class team; swam
# in a university team; walks the dog at least twice a day, park in Steinsel,
# Mullerthal footpaths; midnight bedtime, about eight hours, no phone two hours
# before sleep; last ill seven or eight months ago with a cold, treats it with
# tea, water and sleep; drinks about three cups of water a day, finds two litres
# too much; drinks Crémant because avoiding alcohol in Luxembourg is hard.
#
# The @fill blocks carry frames that recur across any topic: well-causal,
# wann-conditional, obwuel-contrast, wéi-comparative, fir…ze purpose, dofir
# inversion, a general-pronoun "een" modal, a past-tense wéi clause, a frequency
# adverb, a number, a past participle, and an Ech-mengen hedge.

@lesson G1.03 "Talking About Healthy Living"

@word d'Krankheet = the illness
@word den Dokter = the doctor
@word d'Spidol = the hospital
@word d'Erkältung = the cold
@word d'Medikament = the medicine
@word de Kierper = the body
@word d'Kandheet = the childhood
@word d'Kannerzäit = the childhood years
@word d'Groussmamm = the grandmother
@word d'Elteren = the parents
@word d'Kand = the child
@word d'Leit = the people
@word d'Fra = the wife
@word d'Bei = the bee
@word d'Gewunnecht = the habit
@word de Virdeel = the advantage
@word de Nodeel = the disadvantage
@word d'Zukunft = the future
@word de Grond = the reason
@word d'Meenung = the opinion
@word d'Theema = the topic
@word d'Hausdéier = the pet
@word de Fastfood = the fast food
@word d'Glas = the glass
@word de Mount = the month
@word de Dag = the day
@word d'Joer = the year
@word d'Uni = the university
@word mengen = to think
@word denken = to consider
@word benotzen = to use
@word roden = to advise
@word ziichten = to grow
@word riechen = to smell
@word krank = ill
@word wichteg = important
@word méiglech = possible
@word onméiglech = impossible
@word interessant = interesting
@word schlecht = bad
@word professionell = professional
@word jonk = young
@word ukrainesch = Ukrainian
@word gefëllt = filled
@word genuch = enough
@word wéinstens = at least

# --- Opening: why this topic, and what healthy living means ---

@sentence
@question Firwat hutt Dir dat Theema gewielt?
@lu Ech hunn dat Theema gewielt, well ech et wichteg fanne gesond ze sinn.
@distractor-lu langweileg
@distractor-lu Aarbecht
@en I chose that topic because I find it important to be healthy.
@distractor-en boring
@distractor-en work

@sentence
@question Firwat sollen d'Leit un e gesond Liewen denken?
@lu Ech mengen, ech muss eppes Gesonds maachen, fir laang ze liewen an net an d'Spidol ze goen.
@distractor-lu Dokter
@distractor-lu kuerz
@en I think I have to do something healthy in order to live long and not to go to the hospital.
@distractor-en doctor
@distractor-en short

@sentence
@question Wat heescht gesond liewe fir Iech?
@lu Fir mech heescht gesond liewen Uebst iessen, Sport maachen a gutt schlofen.
@distractor-lu Fastfood
@distractor-lu schlecht
@en For me healthy living means eating fruit, doing sport and sleeping well.
@distractor-en burgers
@distractor-en badly

# --- Food and drink ---

@sentence
@question Wat iesst an drénkt Dir fir gesond ze bleiwen?
@lu Ech probéiere manner Séissegkeeten a méi Geméis ze iessen, an och kee Fastfood.
@distractor-lu Alkohol
@distractor-lu Kuch
@en I try to eat fewer sweets and more vegetables, and also no fast food.
@distractor-en alcohol
@distractor-en cake

@sentence
@question Wat hutt Dir dëse Moie giess?
@lu De Moien hunn ech e Jugurt an en Apel giess, an e Kaffi gedronk.
@distractor-lu Kuch
@distractor-lu Téi
@en This morning I ate a yoghurt and an apple, and drank a coffee.
@distractor-en cake
@distractor-en tea
@sentence
@question Wéi ee Geméis a wéi een Uebst iesst Dir gär?
@lu Ech iessen all Dag vill Uebst, zum Beispill Äppel, Meloun a Kiischten.
@distractor-lu Aubergine
@distractor-lu seelen
@en Every day I eat a lot of fruit, for example apples, melon and cherries.
@distractor-en aubergine
@distractor-en rarely

@sentence
@question Kacht Dir doheem? Wéi?
@lu Meng Fra an ech kache vill mat engem Dampuewen doheem.
@distractor-lu Restaurant
@distractor-lu ni
@en My wife and I cook a lot with a steam oven at home.
@distractor-en restaurant
@distractor-en never

@sentence
@question Wat kacht Dir?
@lu Ech kache Grompere a vill Fleesch, mee dat ass net ganz gesond.
@distractor-lu Zalot
@distractor-lu ëmmer
@en I cook potatoes and a lot of meat, but that is not very healthy.
@distractor-en salad
@distractor-en always

@sentence
@question Iesst Dir Bioprodukter?
@lu Jo, ech probéieren ëmmer Bioprodukter ze iessen.
@distractor-lu ni
@distractor-lu Fastfood
@en Yes, I always try to eat organic products.
@distractor-en never
@distractor-en burgers

@sentence
@question Mengt Dir Bioprodukter si besser fir d'Gesondheet? Firwat?
@lu Bioprodukter si besser fir gesond ze liewen, well se net cheemesch sinn.
@distractor-lu schlechter
@distractor-lu deier
@en Organic products are better for living healthily because they are not chemical.
@distractor-en worse
@distractor-en expensive

@sentence
@question Wat haalt Dir vu vegetareschem Iessen?
@lu Ech hu Fleesch gär, an dofir kann ech net nëmme vegetaresch iessen, mee vegetaresch ass gesond.
@distractor-lu Geméis
@distractor-lu ongesond
@en I like meat, and that is why I cannot eat only vegetarian, but vegetarian is healthy.
@distractor-en vegetables
@distractor-en unhealthy

@sentence
@question Wat haalt Dir vu veganem Iessen?
@lu Fir mech ass et onméiglech just vegan ze iessen, well ech gär lecker Iessen hunn.
@distractor-lu méiglech
@distractor-lu Uebst
@en For me it is impossible to eat only vegan, because I like having delicious food.
@distractor-en possible
@distractor-en fruit

@sentence
@question Iesst Dir Fastfood? Wa jo, wéini?
@lu Jo, ech iessen heiansdo Fastfood, wann ech Tëlee kucken.
@distractor-lu ni
@distractor-lu Aarbecht
@en Yes, I sometimes eat fast food when I watch television.
@distractor-en never
@distractor-en work

@sentence
@question Wat iesst Dir da gewéinlech?
@lu Ech iesse gewéinlech Chipsen a salzeg Noss.
@distractor-lu Zalot
@distractor-lu Uebst
@en I usually eat crisps and salty nuts.
@distractor-en salad
@distractor-en fruit

@sentence
@question Wéi beschreift Dir Är Ernärung?
@lu Meng Ernärung ass net perfekt, well ech vill Séissegkeeten iessen.
@distractor-lu Geméis
@distractor-lu Zalot
@en My diet is not perfect because I eat a lot of sweets.
@distractor-en vegetables
@distractor-en salad

@sentence
@question Wéi vill Waasser drénkt Dir gewéinlech pro Dag?
@lu Ech probéieren dräi Taasse Waasser pro Dag ze drénken.
@distractor-lu Liter
@distractor-lu Woch
@en I try to drink three cups of water per day.
@distractor-en litres
@distractor-en week

@sentence
@question Sinn zwee Liter pro Dag net recommandéiert?
@lu Ech mengen, et gi zwee Liter recommandéiert, mee fir mech ass dat ze vill.
@distractor-lu wéineg
@distractor-lu Téi
@en I think two litres are recommended, but for me that is too much.
@distractor-en little
@distractor-en tea

@sentence
@question Drénkt Dir Kaffi oder Alkohol?
@lu Et ass schwéier keen Alkohol zu Lëtzebuerg ze drénken, well et hei immens gudde Crémant gëtt.
@distractor-lu einfach
@distractor-lu Waasser
@en It is difficult to drink no alcohol in Luxembourg, because there is excellent crémant here.
@distractor-en easy
@distractor-en water

# --- Childhood ---

@sentence
@question Wat hutt Dir als Kand gär giess?
@lu Als Kand hunn ech gär Séissegkeete giess, a meng Groussmamm huet mir Kuch gebak.
@distractor-lu Geméis
@distractor-lu gekacht
@en As a child I liked eating sweets, and my grandmother baked me cake.
@distractor-en vegetables
@distractor-en cooked

@sentence
@question Wéi eng Séissegkeete waren dat?
@lu Et ware kleng ukrainesch Séissegkeeten, si heesche verréckt Bei a si mat Gebeess gefëllt.
@distractor-lu grouss
@distractor-lu Hunneg
@en They were small Ukrainian sweets, they are called crazy bee and are filled with jam.
@distractor-en big
@distractor-en honey

@sentence
@question Wéi ee Geméis hat Dir net gär, wéi Dir jonk waart?
@lu Ech hat Aubergine net gär, wéi ech jonk war, a haut hunn ech se nach ëmmer net gär.
@distractor-lu Tomaten
@distractor-lu Courgette
@en I did not like aubergine when I was young, and today I still do not like it.
@distractor-en tomatoes
@distractor-en courgette

@sentence
@question Firwat hutt Dir dat Geméis net gär?
@lu Fir mech richt d'Aubergine wierklech schlecht.
@distractor-lu gutt
@distractor-lu Courgette
@en For me the aubergine really smells bad.
@distractor-en good
@distractor-en courgette

@sentence
@question Wat hunn Är Eltere gekacht, wéi Dir kleng waart?
@lu Meng Eltere hu Kniddelen, Nuddelen, Grompere mat Fleesch, Pasta an Zoppe gekacht.
@distractor-lu Fastfood
@distractor-lu gebak
@en My parents cooked dumplings, noodles, potatoes with meat, pasta and soups.
@distractor-en burgers
@distractor-en baked

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir als Kand gesond giess?
@lu Ech menge jo, ech hunn als Kand gesond giess, well ech vill Uebst a Geméis giess hunn.
@distractor-lu ongesond
@distractor-lu Chipsen
@en I think yes, as a child I ate healthily because I ate a lot of fruit and vegetables.
@distractor-en unhealthily
@distractor-en crisps

# --- Sport and movement ---

@sentence
@question Maacht Dir haut Sport?
@lu Ech maache kee Sport, well ech ze vill Aarbecht hunn a keng Zäit.
@distractor-lu Fräizäit
@distractor-lu Musek
@en I do not do any sport because I have too much work and no time.
@distractor-en leisure
@distractor-en music

@sentence
@question Gitt Dir heiansdo an de Fitnessstudio? Firwat net?
@lu Ech hu keng Zäit wärend der Woch, an um Weekend sinn ech ze midd.
@distractor-lu vill
@distractor-lu fit
@en I have no time during the week, and at the weekend I am too tired.
@distractor-en much
@distractor-en fit

@sentence
@question Wéi ee Sport hutt Dir fréier gemaach?
@lu Ech hu Kendo gemaach, an dat ass japanescht Fechten.
@distractor-lu Fussball
@distractor-lu franséisch
@en I did Kendo, and that is Japanese fencing.
@distractor-en football
@distractor-en French

@sentence
@question Wou a wéi laang hutt Dir dat gemaach?
@lu Ech hunn zwee Joer zu Kiew gemaach a sechs Mount zu Lëtzebuerg.
@distractor-lu Japan
@distractor-lu aacht
@en I did two years in Kyiv and six months in Luxembourg.
@distractor-en Japan
@distractor-en eight

@sentence
@question Wat gefällt Iech un dësem Sport?
@lu De Kendo ass kierperlech exigent, an dofir muss ech och intelligent sinn.
@distractor-lu einfach
@distractor-lu professionell
@en Kendo is physically demanding, and that is why I also have to be intelligent.
@distractor-en easy
@distractor-en professional

@sentence
@question Firwat hutt Dir opgehalen?
@lu Ech hat vill Aarbecht, an ech hat net vill Fräizäit.
@distractor-lu wéineg
@distractor-lu Zäit
@en I had a lot of work, and I did not have much free time.
@distractor-en little
@distractor-en time

@sentence
@question Interesséiert Dir Iech nach fir e Veräin?
@lu Jo, ech géif gär an de lëtzebuergesche Kendo-Club zeréckgoen.
@distractor-lu ni
@distractor-lu Fitnessstudio
@en Yes, I would like to go back to the Luxembourgish Kendo club.
@distractor-en never
@distractor-en gym

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir an enger Schoulsportsekipp gespillt?
@lu Wéi ech an der Schoul war, hunn ech gär Fussball gespillt, well all Klass eng Ekipp hat.
@distractor-lu Uni
@distractor-lu eleng
@en When I was at school I liked playing football, because every class had a team.
@distractor-en university
@distractor-en alone

@sentence
@question Spillt Dir haut nach Fussball?
@lu Nee, ech spille kee Fussball méi, an ech sinn och net an enger Ekipp.
@distractor-lu ëmmer
@distractor-lu Kendo
@en No, I do not play football any more, and I am also not in a team.
@distractor-en always
@distractor-en Kendo

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir och op der Uni an engem Team gespillt?
@lu Op der Uni sinn ech an engem Team geschwommen.
@distractor-lu Schoul
@distractor-lu gelaacht
@en At university I swam in a team.
@distractor-en school
@distractor-en laughed

@sentence
@question Wat maacht Dir fir Iech ze beweegen?
@lu Ech spadséiere vill mat mengem Mupp an ech fuere mam Vëlo.
@distractor-lu Auto
@distractor-lu ni
@en I walk a lot with my dog and I ride my bike.
@distractor-en car
@distractor-en never

@sentence
@question Wéi oft gitt Dir am Dag spadséieren?
@lu Ech muss op d'mannst zwee Mol pro Dag spadséieren.
@distractor-lu Woch
@distractor-lu seelen
@en I have to go for a walk at least twice a day.
@distractor-en week
@distractor-en rarely

@sentence
@question Kënnt Dir schéin Trëppeltoure recommandéieren?
@lu Zu Steesel gëtt et e schéine Park, a mir ginn och oft an de Mëllerdall.
@distractor-lu Stad
@distractor-lu ni
@en In Steinsel there is a beautiful park, and we also often go to the Mullerthal.
@distractor-en city
@distractor-en never

# --- Sleep, mental health and illness ---

@sentence
@question Wat recommandéiert Dir fir gesond ze liewen?
@lu Ech mengen, kee Stress ass am wichtegsten, an de Schlof ass och wichteg.
@distractor-lu Sport
@distractor-lu onwichteg
@en I think no stress is the most important, and the sleep is also important.
@distractor-en sport
@distractor-en unimportant

@sentence
@question Wat maacht Dir fir gutt ze schlofen?
@lu Ech probéieren zwou Stonne virum Schlofe mäi Handy net ze benotzen.
@distractor-lu Tëlee
@distractor-lu ëmmer
@en I try not to use my mobile phone two hours before sleeping.
@distractor-en television
@distractor-en always

@sentence
@question Wat kënnt Dir recommandéiere fir gutt ze schlofen?
@lu Et soll een net ze spéit schlofen, an et soll een och net spéit iessen.
@distractor-lu fréi
@distractor-lu vill
@en One should not sleep too late, and one should also not eat late.
@distractor-en early
@distractor-en much

@sentence
@question Wéi vill Stonne schlooft Dir gewéinlech?
@lu Ech ginn ëm Mëtternuecht schlofen, an ech schlofe gewéinlech aacht Stonnen.
@distractor-lu moies
@distractor-lu dräi
@en I go to sleep at midnight, and I usually sleep eight hours.
@distractor-en morning
@distractor-en three

@sentence
@question Wat maacht Dir fir Är mental Gesondheet ze stäerken?
@lu Ech maachen eppes Relaxes, zum Beispill lauschteren ech Musek a spille Computerspiller.
@distractor-lu Aarbecht
@distractor-lu kierperlech
@en I do something relaxing, for example I listen to music and play computer games.
@distractor-en work
@distractor-en physical

@sentence
@question Sinn Hausdéiere gutt fir d'Gesondheet? Wat mengt Dir?
@lu Dat ass richteg, well ee mat engem Hausdéier vill spadséiere muss.
@distractor-lu falsch
@distractor-lu wéineg
@en That is right, because with a pet one has to walk a lot.
@distractor-en wrong
@distractor-en little

@sentence
@question Muss ee mat engem Hausdéier organiséiert sinn?
@lu Jo, mat engem Mupp muss ee och organiséiert sinn.
@distractor-lu Fësch
@distractor-lu faul
@en Yes, with a dog one also has to be organized.
@distractor-en fish
@distractor-en lazy

@sentence
@question Wéini waart Dir fir d'lescht krank?
@lu Ech mengen, et war viru siwen oder aacht Mount.
@distractor-lu Deeg
@distractor-lu gesond
@en I think it was seven or eight months ago.
@distractor-en days
@distractor-en healthy

@sentence
@question Wat hat Dir?
@lu Ech hat eng Erkältung, mee ech war net am Spidol.
@distractor-lu Dokter
@distractor-lu ëmmer
@en I had a cold, but I was not in the hospital.
@distractor-en doctor
@distractor-en always

@sentence
@question Wat maacht Dir, wann Dir krank sidd?
@lu Wann ech krank sinn, drénken ech vill Téi a Waasser, an ech schlofe vill.
@distractor-lu Kaffi
@distractor-lu wéineg
@en When I am ill I drink a lot of tea and water, and I sleep a lot.
@distractor-en coffee
@distractor-en little

@sentence
@question Gitt Dir da bei den Dokter?
@lu Bei den Dokter ginn ech just, wann d'Erkältung net besser gëtt.
@distractor-lu ëmmer
@distractor-lu Spidol
@en I go to the doctor only when the cold does not get better.
@distractor-en always
@distractor-en hospital

# --- Opinion block ---

@sentence
@question Wat ass de gréisste Virdeel vun engem gesonde Liewen?
@lu De gréisste Virdeel ass, datt ech laang liewen an net oft krank sinn.
@distractor-lu Nodeel
@distractor-lu kuerz
@en The biggest advantage is that I live long and am not often ill.
@distractor-en disadvantage
@distractor-en short

@sentence
@question Ass gesond iessen deier?
@lu Bioprodukter si méi deier, mee fir mech ass d'Gesondheet méi wichteg wéi de Preis.
@distractor-lu bëlleg
@distractor-lu Fastfood
@en Organic products are more expensive, but for me the health is more important than the price.
@distractor-en cheap
@distractor-en burgers

@sentence
@question Wëllt Dir Är Gewunnechten an Zukunft änneren?
@lu An Zukunft wëll ech manner Séissegkeeten iessen a méi Sport maachen.
@distractor-lu Fastfood
@distractor-lu Chipsen
@en In the future I want to eat fewer sweets and do more sport.
@distractor-en burgers
@distractor-en crisps

@sentence
@question Wat géift Dir engem roden, dee gesond liewe wëllt?
@lu Ech géif engem roden all Dag ze spadséieren, well d'Beweegung méi wichteg ass wéi Kalorien.
@distractor-lu Woch
@distractor-lu Stress
@en I would advise someone to walk every day, because the exercise is more important than calories.
@distractor-en week
@distractor-en stress

